WEBVTT

00:08:29.796 --> 00:08:31.756
Not awesome. Not awful.

00:08:32.636 --> 00:08:34.836
And minus one is you're struggling.

00:08:35.556 --> 00:08:37.276
Here's mine for this year.

00:08:37.276 --> 00:08:39.476
For Productivity and Profit, I'm a one.

00:08:39.876 --> 00:08:42.076
I have a good job, I have a good salary,

00:08:42.076 --> 00:08:43.436
I have a roof over my head,

00:08:43.436 --> 00:08:44.716
I can pay the bills.

00:08:45.396 --> 00:08:46.956
But here's the thing.

00:08:46.996 --> 00:08:49.076
You can't score more than a one,

00:08:49.116 --> 00:08:53.316
so it becomes impossible to pack
all your happiness into one category.

00:08:54.036 --> 00:08:57.556
And it's like we're all trying
to get to a two on Productivity,

00:08:57.556 --> 00:08:59.076
but to what extent?

00:08:59.756 --> 00:09:01.556
The next area is People.